                            "centerStart",
                            "center",
                            "centerEnd",
                            "bottomStart",
                            "bottomCenter",
                            "bottomEnd"
                        ],
                        "notes": "How a parent Box aligns this column. The renderer has always read `alignment` off any Box child and the exporter has always emitted `.align(...)` for it; only the declaration was missing, so a centred column was inexpressible."
